title: "Grameen microcredit and women's empowerment: reproducible companion"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/archowdhury328-cloud/grameen-microcredit-womens-empowerment"
abstract: >-
  Code, transcribed published aggregates, synthetic demonstration data, regression and qualitative-coding tooling that
  accompany Karim et al. (2024), IJCESEN 10(4):2578-2589. Reproduces the paper's summary charts from its printed
  numbers; does not reproduce the paper's effects, whose row-level data are held by the corresponding author.
